T1  - The precipitation variability of the wet and dry season at the interannual and interdecadal scales over eastern China (1901-2016): the impacts of the Pacific Ocean
JF  - HYDROLOGY AND EARTH SYSTEM SCIENCES
PY  - 2021/03/25
VL  - 25
IS  - 3
SP  - 1467
